      "id": "note_032",
      "title": "Markdown formatting demo",
      "body": "# Release checklist\n\nMark items **bold** when done and _italic_ when blocked.\n\n- Run `npm test`\n- Update the [changelog](https://example.com/changelog)\n- Tag the release\n\n> Ship on Friday only with sign-off.\n\n```\nnpm run build\n```",
      "created_at": "2026-07-05T09:33:00.000Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-07-05T09:33:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "note_031",
